  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan puts gruel mud up for sale in treasure yellow heaven and asks for Immortal Gu Gruel Mud’s recipe in exchange, Immortal Mudfeet is the bidder whose Immortal Gruel Mud remnant recipe shows a sixty-five feet high treasure light and who offers hairy men to close the gap with richer bids.",
      "chapters": [
        491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven",
        "rcp_gruel_mud_immortal_gu_remnant_recipe",
        "gu_gruel_mud"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is present when Little Hu Immortal conveys Fang Yuan’s reply, and he immediately offers ten thousand hairy men. Fang Yuan rejects an all-young batch as weak for refinement work, and after haggling Immortal Mudfeet sells over three thousand old hairy men and over seven thousand young hairy men, with Fang Yuan adding half an immortal essence stone on top. His blessed land has excess hairy men in those years, so he is trying to sell a batch cheaply.",
      "chapters": [
        491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remnant-recipe-and-hairy-men",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_little_hu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The remnant recipe he delivers holds only about sixty percent of its contents, and Fang Yuan judges those contents have been tampered many times, so the real lines still need sorting. Fang Yuan still treats that damaged base as enough foundation to deduce a complete Immortal Gu Gruel Mud recipe later.",
      "chapters": [
        491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "remnant-recipe-and-hairy-men",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation writes Immortal Mudfeet. No Chinese characters for the title appear in the English chapter text used here.",
